FITBUDDY – AI FITNESS PLAN GENERATOR USING GEMINI MODELS

PHASE 1: BRAINSTORMING & IDEATION

1. PROJECT IDEA

FitBuddy is an AI-powered fitness assistant that generates
personalized fitness plans using Google Gemini models.

2. PROBLEM IDENTIFICATION

Many people want to improve their fitness but are unsure
which exercises and routines are suitable for their fitness
goals and experience level.

3. PROPOSED SOLUTION

FitBuddy collects basic information from the user and uses
Gemini AI to generate a personalized fitness plan.

4. TARGET USERS

• Beginners
• Students
• Fitness enthusiasts
• People starting a workout routine

5. MAIN FEATURES

• User fitness information
• Fitness goal selection
• AI-generated workout plan
• Exercise recommendations
• General nutrition suggestions
• Personalized weekly plan
• Option to generate a new plan

6. TECHNOLOGY IDEA

Frontend: HTML, CSS, JavaScript
AI: Google Gemini
Backend: To be decided according to project requirements

7. EXPECTED BENEFITS

• Saves time in creating a fitness routine
• Provides personalized suggestions
• Easy for beginners to understand
• Uses Generative AI for customized recommendations

8. PROJECT GOAL

To develop an easy-to-use AI fitness assistant that helps
users generate personalized fitness plans using Google
Gemini models.


